# AgentOS Dashboard

AgentOS Dashboard is an intuitive, modular AI-first platform designed to simplify the creation, orchestration, and visualization of autonomous agents and workflows. It integrates powerful backend logic, flexible frontend UX, custom dashboards, and a dynamic living knowledge base into one cohesive ecosystem.

