Upon completion, the project will provide:

- **Fully Functional AI Agent Dashboard:** User-friendly interface for building, managing, and interacting with AI-driven agents.
- **Custom Workflow Automation:** Fully integrated no-code workflow automation (N8N) with extensible API endpoints.
- **Real-Time Analytics & Visualization:** Customizable dashboards to monitor, analyze, and visualize diverse data streams.
- **Dynamic Knowledge Base & Context Management:** Robust backend for context and knowledge management, optimized with embedding-based storage.
- **Scalable Multi-Agent System:** Framework for collaborative and parallel processing with sophisticated agent orchestration capabilities.
- **Comprehensive Documentation:** Clear, detailed documentation to support continuous development and onboarding.

